{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The USB extension cables and hub fit how I use accessories: extra reach and ports would help me connect my card reader and other devices.",
    "A streaming stick feels like a useful addition to my TV and DVD player, though I would choose the simpler stick because my listed TV is 720p."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Buying memory cards does not mean I need a 4TB internal SSD; I have not indicated a computer storage upgrade.",
    "The smart speakers, battery backup, large Ethernet switch, and short Ethernet cable pack solve needs I do not currently have, even though they are electronics accessories."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning a Fire tablet seems to have been taken as interest in more Alexa devices, but voice control is not what I am looking for now.",
    "My cable and surge protector purchases seem to have been stretched into interest in larger networking and computer-power setups."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated purchases of camera supports, memory cards, a card reader, and a lens cap point toward practical accessories for equipment I already use.",
    "The connection type, useful cable length, and scale of the setup matter to me: USB accessories fit my current needs better than six short Ethernet cables or a 24-port switch."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understood my interest in useful device accessories, but stretched it into smart-home and computer upgrades I do not currently need."
}"}
